        "detailed_description": "<h1>【Announcement : About the Demo】</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Demo Version</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4174990/extras/69a75188a4cf17d4d448b18f96a2dcaa.avif?t=1783155642\" width=460 height=214 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the core gameplay in the demo!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Demo Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 Inning Only</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only Slow Fastballs are Thrown</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play Both Teams Alternately</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click the Mouse to Bat</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy the demo, please check out the full version!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SUPER BOARD BASEBALL — Swing with a single click! Simple controls, intense action!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SUPER BOARD BASEBALL is a unique arcade baseball game inspired by classic Japanese tabletop baseball games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using only a mouse, time your swing perfectly and watch the board determine the outcome of every hit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where the ball hits the board determines the result, including Home Runs, Hits, and Outs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience fast-paced baseball action with simple controls that anyone can learn in seconds.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4174990/extras/b709ac29197f8bf621b271234e1912ae.poster.avif?t=1783155642\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4174990/extras/b709ac29197f8bf621b271234e1912ae.webm?t=1783155642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4174990/extras/b709ac29197f8bf621b271234e1912ae.mp4?t=1783155642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4174990/extras/60a19f36c46a74e53c129e4379c04868.poster.avif?t=1783155642\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4174990/extras/60a19f36c46a74e53c129e4379c04868.webm?t=1783155642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4174990/extras/60a19f36c46a74e53c129e4379c04868.mp4?t=1783155642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pitching and defense are fully automated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All you need to do is click the mouse at the perfect moment and send the ball into play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4174990/extras/eeeb1ecd257711a6dfe2300edf670703.avif?t=1783155642\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4174990/extras_big/eeeb1ecd257711a6dfe2300edf670703.webp?t=1783155642 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The camera dynamically follows the ball across the field, keeping the action easy to follow and exciting from start to finish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4174990/extras/e0a0a95ba985f88fa4d1c2fe6601dd73.poster.avif?t=1783155642\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4174990/extras/e0a0a95ba985f88fa4d1c2fe6601dd73.webm?t=1783155642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4174990/extras/e0a0a95ba985f88fa4d1c2fe6601dd73.mp4?t=1783155642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hit a Home Run and celebrate with colorful fireworks lighting up the stadium.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4174990/extras/142c39aad1549033e182bcbf21362b47.avif?t=1783155642\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4174990/extras_big/142c39aad1549033e182bcbf21362b47.webp?t=1783155642 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from three CPU difficulty levels:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Easy<br>• Normal<br>• Hard</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a beginner or a seasoned player, there's a challenge waiting for you.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4174990/extras/96ae8d3a9f11b03bd693ef5dc491d1c4.avif?t=1783155642\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4174990/extras_big/96ae8d3a9f11b03bd693ef5dc491d1c4.webp?t=1783155642 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play against a friend in local two-player mode on the same PC.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players take turns using the same mouse each half-inning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4174990/extras/186dfe44c16f4ac09dec03bca155d84a.avif?t=1783155642\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4174990/extras_big/186dfe44c16f4ac09dec03bca155d84a.webp?t=1783155642 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between 1, 3, 5, or 9 innings before each game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a quick match in just a few minutes or settle in for a full baseball showdown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4174990/extras/84128092809e69da4cb9e0e5a9925a27.avif?t=1783155642\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4174990/extras_big/84128092809e69da4cb9e0e5a9925a27.webp?t=1783155642 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With simple controls, fast-paced gameplay, and satisfying batting action, SUPER BOARD BASEBALL delivers a fresh and accessible take on baseball games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Redistribution is strictly prohibited.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Simple Rules &amp; Terms (For First-Time Baseball Players)</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strike</strong> = Missed hit.<br>3 strikes = 1 out.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ball</strong> = Safe pitch (no swing).<br>4 balls = the batter goes to first base.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Out</strong> = Big mistake.<br>3 outs = switch offense and defense.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1 Inning</strong> = 1 turn.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1 Game</strong> = 9 innings.<br>If the score is tied after 9 innings, extra innings are played.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hit</strong> = Reach base and advance runners<br>according to the judgment panel shown in-game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run (Score)</strong> = A runner returns to home base.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Home Run</strong> = Instant score.<br>All runners on base also score.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・You don’t need to remember these.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Just play once, and you’ll get it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You don’t need baseball knowledge — just click and play.</strong></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SUPER BOARD BASEBALL — Swing with a single click! Simple controls, intense action!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SUPER BOARD BASEBALL is a unique arcade baseball game inspired by classic Japanese tabletop baseball games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using only a mouse, time your swing perfectly and watch the board determine the outcome of every hit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where the ball hits the board determines the result, including Home Runs, Hits, and Outs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience fast-paced baseball action with simple controls that anyone can learn in seconds.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4174990/extras/b709ac29197f8bf621b271234e1912ae.poster.avif?t=1783155642\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4174990/extras/b709ac29197f8bf621b271234e1912ae.webm?t=1783155642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4174990/extras/b709ac29197f8bf621b271234e1912ae.mp4?t=1783155642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4174990/extras/60a19f36c46a74e53c129e4379c04868.poster.avif?t=1783155642\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4174990/extras/60a19f36c46a74e53c129e4379c04868.webm?t=1783155642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4174990/extras/60a19f36c46a74e53c129e4379c04868.mp4?t=1783155642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pitching and defen